e installer centres the seat clip's figure on the seated capsule. placement: crowd activities whose clips sit or lean on a prop behind the NPC (CrowdWalker stands gap metres in front of it: a collider named like prop within reach at height, or with no prop name the wall straight behind). props: a small hand prop shown while a crowd activity plays (hook for the SmokeCorner cigarette: {activity, bone, position [m], rotation [deg] in the bone frame, size [m] of a plain cylinder or prefab: an asset path}). Clips of 2026-10-10 (Claude, Working/Reviews/BuddyAnimations_Claude_2026-10-10/build_review.md) still need Fedya's OK.",
